":"Top Glove's FY2026 (ended 31 Aug) results improved significantly, with revenue up 39.7% YoY and net profit up 352.6% YoY. The company declared a tax-exempt final dividend of 1.50 sen per share, with ex-date on 23 Nov. Meanwhile, KWAP filed frequent changes in shareholding in October, and new shares continued to be listed from warrant conversions and ESOS.","notable_en":["Declared a tax-exempt final dividend of 1.50 sen per share for FY2026.","FY2026 revenue rose 39.7% YoY to RM1.248 billion, net profit up 352.6% YoY to RM157.6 million.","KWAP filed multiple changes in shareholding in October."],"risks_en":["Executive Chairman Lim Wee Chai and Executive Director Lim Hooi Sin indicated intention to deal in company shares during the closed period.","New shares continue to be issued from warrant conversions and ESOS, with latest share capital at about 8.218 billion shares."],"earnings_en":"FY2026 revenue was RM1.248 billion, up 39.7% YoY; net profit was RM157.6 million, up 352.6% YoY; net margin rose from 7.4% to 12.6%."}